# S242 / CACHE-01. The pedagogy-v3 worker precache is an EVIDENCE ACCELERATOR, derived entirely
# from tracked source. It is never source-of-truth curriculum and must never reach a release
# archive, so it is ignored here AND listed in scripts/native-integrity.mjs, which fails if a
# release contains one. Rebuild with: node scripts/cache/pedagogy-v3-cache.mjs
.cowork-cache/
